    "title": "AI Accounting & Finance Tools for Solopreneurs in Asia (2026)",
    "excerpt": "Manage invoices, expenses, taxes, and bookkeeping across 10+ Asian markets with AI accounting tools. Compare Wave, Xero, Zoho Books, Pabbly, and more fo...",
    "date": "2026-05-15",
    "author": "Apifeny Team",
