    "title": "AI for Construction in Asia (2026): From Blueprint to Handover — Tools That Actually Work on Site",
    "excerpt": "AI is reshaping construction across Asia — from AI-assisted BIM design and automated quantity takeoffs to computer vision safety monitoring and predictive schedule management. This guide covers 20+ real tools used by developers, contractors, and architects in Singapore, Malaysia, Hong Kong, India, and China.",
